    color6: ("black", "black")
    color7: ("black", "black")
    color8: ("black", "black")
    color9: ("black", "black")
    comment: 'THE indicator to trust. Tone power minus off-tone power.

      Above ~6 dB the channel is really receiving. Near 0 dB it is

      NOT, no matter how steady its phase trace looks -- a channel

      with no signal can still track ch0 perfectly through internal

      crosstalk, which is coherent and therefore rock stable.'
    factor1: '1'
    factor10: '1'
    factor2: '1'
    factor3: '1'
    factor4: '1'
    factor5: '1'
    factor6: '1'
    factor7: '1'
    factor8: '1'
    factor9: '1'
